{"title": "Crude Frenzy", "pageid": 18544, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crude_Frenzy", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Extra_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp/300px-Extra_Attack.webp, /w/images/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp/300px-Extra_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Extra_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Crude Frenzy</b> is a passive goblin feature that lets them attack multiple times with the second attack at Disadvantage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This goblin can make an additional free attack after making a Main Hand Attack, but the second attack has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on its <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Crusher\" title=\"Crusher\">Crusher</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fezzerk\" title=\"Fezzerk\">Fezzerk</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rozzak\" title=\"Rozzak\">Rozzak</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skrut\" title=\"Skrut\">Skrut</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Za%27krug\" title=\"Za'krug\">Za'krug</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zurga\" title=\"Zurga\">Zurga</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715085056\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 613/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2775/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1501/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 391/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643700/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.776      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.776      1 -total\n 32.72%    8.760      1 Template:Disadvantage\n 31.59%    8.459      1 Template:Icon_link\n 30.24%    8.097      1 Template:Icon_text\n 26.42%    7.073      2 Template:Trim\n 23.25%    6.225      1 Template:Ifempty\n 14.21%    3.805      1 Template:PageSeo\n 13.39%    3.586      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 13.12%    3.512      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:18544-0!canonical and timestamp 202607